    "q-221762": {
      "dom_id": "step-q221762",
      "name": "Question 11",
      "problem": "Consider the equivalence relation $∼$ on the set $A={0,1,2,…,9},$ defined by $a∼b$ if $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi a)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi b).$ How many distinct equivalence classes does $∼$ partition $A$ into?",
      "worked_solution": "The equivalence classes of $∼$ partition $A,$ meaning that any element $a\\in A$ belongs to exactly one distinct equivalence class.\n\nSo, we compute equivalence classes until all the elements of $A$ have been placed into an equivalence class.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[0] & ={a\\in A∣a∼0} \\\\  & ={a\\in A∣\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi a)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 0)} \\\\  & ={a\\in A∣\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi a)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)} \\\\  & ={a\\in A∣\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi a)=1} \\\\  & ={0,2,4,6,8} \\\\  \\\\ [1] & ={a\\in A∣a∼1} \\\\  & ={a\\in A∣\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi a)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 1)} \\\\  & ={a\\in A∣\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi a)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi )} \\\\  & ={a\\in A∣\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi a)=-1} \\\\  & ={1,3,5,7,9} \\\\ \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll of the elements of $A$ have been placed into an equivalence class, so we are done.\n\nWe have $2$ distinct equivalence classes:\n\n$$\n[0]={0,2,4,6,8},\\,[1]={1,3,5,7,9}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-221762-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "1",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"174\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-221762-b",
